<p>Punctuation: –, —, %, #, @, †.</p>
<p>Currency: €, $, £, ¥.</p>
<p>Marks: •, ⋆, ✓, ©.</p>
<p>Quotes: “, ”, «, ».</p>
<p>Brackets: ⟦, ⟧.</p>
<p>Shapes: ◯, ⬤, ▶.</p>
<p>In math: <span class="math inline">\(a \cdot b\)</span>, <span
class="math inline">\(a \pm b\)</span>, <span class="math inline">\(a
\bullet b\)</span>, <span class="math inline">\(a \bullet
b\)</span>.</p>
<p>More math: <span class="math inline">\(a⟦b⟧\)</span>, <span
class="math inline">\(a ::= b\)</span>.</p>
